# Diagnostic, not a receipt: the 50x control's page at 1x and then at 50x,
# in one run (physics catalog plan, 2026-10-06, "Base it on the page's own
# 1x"), to see how a bar relative to the page's 1x reads calm and under load.
# Run with ?nodes=24&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=1.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 1
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 4
mark-pace one-x
log-physics one-x
log-intervals one-x
click role:combobox Speed
settle 1
click role:option 50x
settle 2
assert snap physics-speed == 50
timing start speed-fifty
settle 4
timing stop
log-physics fifty
log-pace fifty
log-intervals fifty
log diag speed fifty complete
